{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10328","headline":"单父逢邓司仓覆仓库因而有赠 · 高适","name":"单父逢邓司仓覆仓库因而有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邦牧今坐啸，羣贤趋纪纲。\n四人忽不扰，耕者遥相望。\n粲粲府中妙，授词如履霜。\n炎炎伏热时，草木无晶光。\n匹马度睢水，清风何激扬。\n校缗阅帑藏，发廪欣斯箱。\n邂逅得相逢，欢言至夕阳。\n开襟自公余，载酒登琴堂。\n举桮挹山川，寓目穷毫芒。\n白鸟向田尽，青蝉归路长。\n醉中不惜别，况乃正游梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}